<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Winterthur.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Winterthur.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued a total of 1.5 million European-style COOL (Chance of Optimal Leverage) warrants, on Winterthur registered shares, lead manager Goldman Sachs Group said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one shares.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    770.00 SFR		PREMIUM	=</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     9.85 SFR		  GEARING	=</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   16.SEP.97		 PAYDATE	23.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWIIS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  757 SFR</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
